      "source": "dong_chinese",
      "field": "hanzi.etymology_notes[1]",
      "text": "Pictograph of the outline of a face, with an eye (目) in the middle. In simplified Chinese 面 is also used to mean \"noodles\", while in traditional Chinese this meaning is written with a separate character 麵.",
      "record_character": "面",
      "kind": "imported_excerpt"
    },
    {
